WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:33.980
[coughs]

3
00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:36.830
<b>Fool of a Lord</b>

4
00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:41.570
Hey! Buggy!
Guess who's back!

5
00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:43.070
Captain Roger's here!

6
00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:44.700
Captain Roger?

7
00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:45.990
[gasps]

8
00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:53.500
[Buggy]
It's really them!

9
00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:56.500
And what a flashy entrance, too!

10
00:01:56.500 --> 00:02:01.760
Yeah! It's Roger!

11
00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:12.270
[inaudible]

12
00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:24.610
[Oden]
When Roger
returned from Laugh Tale,

13
00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:27.860
Redtaro greeted him
gleefully with a question,

14
00:02:27.860 --> 00:02:30.990
only to break down into
tears moments later.

15
00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:38.140
[Oden]
The birth of
the King of the Pirates

16
00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:39.510
the King of the Pirates.

17
00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:42.090
caused quite a commotion
around the world,

18
00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:45.180
which prompted the Navy
to react aggressively.

19
00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:49.220
[Rayleigh]
"The man who achieved
wealth, fame, and power."

20
00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:52.270
It calls you a legend
of our time.

21
00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:54.980
"The King of the Pirates,
Gold Roger"!

22
00:02:54.980 --> 00:03:00.230
[laughs]
Except,
it's Gol D. Roger.

23
00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:05.300
[yells]

24
00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:04.490
Although, being called "King of
the Pirates" ain't so bad!

25
00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:06.280
It's no wonder
the World Government

26
00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:07.950
wants to cover up your name.

27
00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:10.790
You've really earned
that reputation of yours!

28
00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:11.800
[sighs]

29
00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:12.120
Roger!

30
00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:14.040
[Oden]
The world had
a name for everything

31
00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:16.750
that Roger gained
on the final island.

32
00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:21.720
They called it "The legendary
treasure, One Piece"!

33
00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:23.970
[Gold Roger]
They have no idea!

34
00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:25.380
[Gold Roger laughs]

35
00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:27.140
[Rayleigh]
You do realize
that because of your fame,

36
00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:30.470
everyone is going to be
out to get you, right?

37
00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.770
We'll take down Roger!

38
00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:38.610
[pirates yell]

39
00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:45.610
[Garp]
Find him at all costs!

40
00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:47.910
Let's nab his treasure
for ourselves!

41
00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:51.620
They say he's got everything
tucked away in his stash!

42
00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:09.800
Looking back now,
it's been a miraculous journey.

43
00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:11.720
Hard to believe
how far we made it,

44
00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:14.940
especially with my
short life expectancy.

45
00:04:15.890 --> 00:04:18.770
I have nothing but
gratitude to you all!

46
00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:22.980
[gasps]
Whoa, whoa! Come on now!

47
00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:24.650
Where's this junk coming from?

48
00:04:24.650 --> 00:04:26.110
You can't lay it on this thick!

49
00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:27.820
Don't make me blush, Captain!

50
00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:28.950
Ya rascal!

51
00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:34.540
[all laughing]

52
00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:42.130
Then I'll come out and say it.

53
00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:45.460
We're ready! Just lay it on us!

54
00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:58.390
I am hereby disbanding
the Roger Pirates!

55
00:04:58.390 --> 00:05:00.730
[Shanks gasps]

56
00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:04.280
[Roger pirates cry]

57
00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:24.090
[Sea King A]
The birth is at hand!

58
00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:27.130
[Sea King B]
Our sovereign
shall soon be born!

59
00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:30.260
[Sea King A]
And another in a distant sea.

60
00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:32.930
[Sea King B]
And in time,
the two rulers shall meet,

61
00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:35.850
a joy that even
the whales sing of.

62
00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:37.140
[gasps]

63
00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:43.440
[Sea King A]
We have waited for
this day for far too long.

64
00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:46.200
[Sea King B]
It's nearly here

65
00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:48.960
and surely all shall
go well this time.

66
00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:51.870
[Sea King A]
Only ten until the birth.

67
00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:54.580
[Sea King B]
Then another 15 to grow.

68
00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:57.760
Who? Who are you?

69
00:05:57.760 --> 00:06:01.630
How are you able to talk so
loudly all the way down here?

70
00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:05.550
[Gold Roger]
So, Sharley,

71
00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:07.970
when will this Mermaid
Princess be born?

72
00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:09.720
This many!

73
00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:14.900
About that voice.

74
00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:17.400
[gasps]
You heard it?

75
00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:20.240
[Gold Roger]
I'm certain
it's telling the truth.

76
00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:22.610
Soon a great person
will be born,

77
00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:25.950
and one day,
they'll even surpass us!

78
00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:33.960
[Gold Roger]
Perhaps we were
a bit before our time.

79
00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:39.000
[Rayleigh]
I do wonder who will
find the One Piece in the end.

80
00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:41.960
That would be my son, obviously!

81
00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:43.550
[Rayleigh]
You don't have one.

82
00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:46.220
[Gold Roger]
Not yet, but I may
have one in the future!

83
00:06:46.220 --> 00:06:50.140
[Roger pirates laugh]

84
00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:52.730
[Gold Roger]
All right! Time to drink!

85
00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:55.440
Head us toward someplace
with no Navy!

86
00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:57.270
I'm gonna get off
the ship first!

87
00:06:59.820 --> 00:07:02.940
[Roger pirates]
Yeah!

88
00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.400
[both laughing]

89
00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:06.200
Ah, listen up!

90
00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:10.370
Be sure that Oden makes it
home safely after me!

91
00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:13.200
– [Rayleigh] Of course!
– [Roger pirates laughing]

92
00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:17.710
By the way, Oden,
I plan to meet with Whitebeard

93
00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:19.920
once more before I keel over.

94
00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:23.880
Should I have him send Izo
back to Wano as well?

95
00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:29.300
Nope. He's gotten quite
comfortable on that ship.

96
00:07:29.890 --> 00:07:33.640
Promise you'll tell him to
take care of White-kichi for me.

97
00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:35.900
[Gold Roger]
All right. Will do!

98
00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:47.500
[Oden]
Roger had
a few words with Rayleigh.

99
00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:49.300
The man known as "The Dark King"

100
00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:52.170
was his oldest friend
and confidant.

101
00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:00.640
[Oden]
Then Roger disembarked.

102
00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:03.850
[Oden]
The ship's doctor,
Crocus, sent him off

103
00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:06.560
with a bundle of
medicine for treatment.

104
00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:10.440
His disease was
in its final stages.

105
00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:13.240
This was a man's farewell.

106
00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:14.820
Not a single tear was shed

107
00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:17.450
as were we filled
with solemnness.

108
00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:23.120
[Oden]
Crying wouldn't befit
the King of the Pirates' crew!

109
00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:27.250
So we stood, utterly stoic!

110
00:08:27.990 --> 00:08:33.410
<b>Off the Coast

of Wano</b>

111
00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:39.300
[Taro]
Huh?
This is unbelievable.

112
00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:43.050
And look at all those
wrecked ships over there!

113
00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:46.100
[Oden]
As expected,
this next part will be

114
00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:48.180
difficult to maneuver.

115
00:08:48.180 --> 00:08:49.600
One wrong turn into a current,

116
00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:52.310
and your vessel
will be in pieces!

117
00:08:52.310 --> 00:08:55.110
Until this point, we had
reason to close the country,

118
00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:56.650
but that has changed!

119
00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:57.890
We must open its ports to the
world before "Joyboy" comes!

120
00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:58.700
Oden!

121
00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:09.130
You all better take care of
yourselves! Until next time!

122
00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:14.600
[Oden]
It's not as though
I was the one who was dying,

123
00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:17.890
so we parted ways
with smiles on our faces!

124
00:09:18.180 --> 00:09:20.940
We all knew we would
meet again one day!

125
00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:29.150
[gasps]

126
00:09:30.740 --> 00:09:32.320
My dear!

127
00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:34.360
– How I've missed you!
– My beloved wife!

128
00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:36.780
I've waited so long
for this day!

129
00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:46.130
Toki! Momonosuke! Hiyori!

130
00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:50.510
[Oden]
I missed you, too! Terribly!

131
00:09:53.720 --> 00:09:56.140
I go out to sea for a bit
and as soon as I come home,

132
00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:57.690
you're all grown up!

133
00:09:57.690 --> 00:10:01.270
Yes! I hope all has been well
while you were away!

134
00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:06.070
[Oden]
My boy has
proper manners, too!

135
00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:08.490
[gasps]

136
00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:10.360
Good to have you back, my lord.

137
00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:13.040
You jackass.

138
00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:16.250
Is this how you properly
address your lord?

139
00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:20.710
I was unaware that you were
deserving of such things.

140
00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:24.690
[Townspeople cheering]

141
00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:27.610
It's so nice to see you!

142
00:10:27.610 --> 00:10:29.440
Lord Oden! Welcome back!

143
00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:30.900
How was your trip?

144
00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:35.350
Otoki! How wonderful!

145
00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:40.120
[Townspeople cheering]

146
00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:44.740
I didn't expect that
I'd still be so popular.

147
00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.490
I neglected our country
for quite some time!

148
00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:49.990
I thought they'd be angrier.

149
00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:53.370
Thank your wife.
This is the result of Lady Toki.

150
00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:55.790
She is a woman of
great character.

151
00:10:55.790 --> 00:10:57.290
Truly beloved by all.

152
00:10:57.290 --> 00:10:59.250
Every day, she would
devote herself fully

153
00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:01.630
to helping citizens
around the town.

154
00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:04.090
She toiled and
sweated by their side

155
00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:06.010
and told tales of your triumphs,

156
00:11:06.010 --> 00:11:08.720
but never acted haughty
because of her stature.

157
00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:10.800
No surprise the Lady
Toki is beloved,

158
00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:13.640
and the people here are quite
fond of your children, as well.

159
00:11:13.640 --> 00:11:15.310
Even in your absence,
they have spoken

160
00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:17.020
nothing but praise
for you, as well.

161
00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:18.190
[gasps]

162
00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:20.230
And that's not all,
the number of people

163
00:11:20.230 --> 00:11:21.860
who had ill will
towards you-gara

164
00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:23.690
has dwindled down to nothing.

165
00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:26.530
Incredible! You're all too kind!

166
00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:27.860
My thanks!

167
00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:29.200
Please, don't mention it!

168
00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:31.580
We did it out of our love
for you, right, kids?

169
00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:33.540
[Oden laughs]

170
00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:37.290
I'm jealous! I wish
the ladies liked me!

171
00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:42.430
Hey, Kiku! I have
some news about Izo!

172
00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:45.180
I already heard it all
from Doggy and Kitty!

173
00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:47.180
I'm glad he's well.

174
00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:52.110
Great! Tell me, what has
become of Denjiro and Ashura?

175
00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:54.480
I didn't see them
last year either.

176
00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:56.820
Ashura became
the boss of the yakuza

177
00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.320
and mountain bandits in Kuri

178
00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:00.620
to make sure they
don't misbehave.

179
00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:04.040
Denjiro on the other hand has
been wandering all over Wano,

180
00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:06.330
borrowing and paying back money.

181
00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:10.170
Neither of those lifestyles
sound very comfortable,

182
00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:13.000
or like they belong
in a thriving nation.

183
00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:14.460
Indeed.

184
00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:16.260
There is another reason
that everyone is

185
00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:18.880
overjoyed about your return.

186
00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:22.760
[Kin'emon]
I will tell you
the story from the beginning.

187
00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:24.810
After you left,
we did our best to run Kuri

188
00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:26.930
in the absence of its Daimyo.

189
00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:28.810
However, it was no easy task,

190
00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:31.520
even with the help of
the citizens at our side.

191
00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:34.400
I thank you.
It must have been hard.

192
00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:37.110
Tell me, how is
my father faring?

193
00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:44.200
I have some unfortunate news.

194
00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:45.740
[Oden]
I see!

195
00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:51.000
That would mean he really was
in poor health, I suppose.

196
00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:54.590
[Oden]
What a shame.

197
00:12:54.590 --> 00:12:57.010
I wish I'd been there for him
on his deathbed.

198
00:12:57.010 --> 00:13:00.300
There's a conundrum concerning
the shogun's successor!

199
00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:03.180
Before passing,
Lord Sukiyaki made a request

200
00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:04.600
that was quite odd.

201
00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:05.600
It involves Orochi.

202
00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:07.180
[Oden gasps]

203
00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:09.980
[Orochi]
Please lend me money!

204
00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:14.980
[Oden]
The more I heard,
the more confused I was.

205
00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:18.030
Suddenly, Orochi was
like a brother to me?

206
00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:21.280
All I did was lend him money
out of respect to Yasu!

207
00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:24.740
That man never once returned
a single coin of it, either.

208
00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:27.450
I also learned that
Orochi is a descendant

209
00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:31.370
of the Kurozumi Clan that caused
a terrible incident in the past.

210
00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:33.170
So it was even more
shocking to hear that

211
00:13:33.170 --> 00:13:37.420
he was occupying the position
of shogun as my proxy.

212
00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:39.380
Did you notice the factories?

213
00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:41.090
You must have on your way here.

214
00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:43.590
Each is filled with men
who oversee the labor.

215
00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:45.050
They're clear
evidence our country

216
00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:46.510
has changed for the worse.

217
00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:49.560
In every region, the workers
are forced to slave away.

218
00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:52.230
Their wages are far too
meager to survive on.

219
00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:54.020
All thanks to the shogun!

220
00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:55.650
But how can this be?

221
00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:57.400
Why is the whole
country obeying orders

222
00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:59.110
from a lowlife like Orochi?

223
00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:00.900
It's simple, he has the support

224
00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:03.320
of a despicable pirate
named Kaido.

225
00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:05.660
He's a beast in strength
and character alike!

226
00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:08.990
Kaido's the reason why Orochi
can do as he pleases!

227
00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:11.040
It's true! There was one time
we tried to take a stand...

228
00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:13.210
[Toki]
Not another word, Kin'emon!

229
00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:14.790
Leave it at that!

230
00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:18.170
Tell me! What is it? Speak up!

231
00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:24.130
Raizo! Take Lord Momonosuke
and Lady Hiyori out of the room!

232
00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:26.260
Sir! Pardon!

233
00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:30.110
[Kin'emon]
This incident took
place about a half a year ago.

234
00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:31.280
There was a man who refused to

235
00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:34.070
work at a weapons
factory, and, well...

236
00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:38.360
His family was murdered!

237
00:14:39.780 --> 00:14:42.330
We felt we could no
longer stay passive

238
00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:44.370
in the face of such cruelty.

239
00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:47.120
With fury in our hearts,
and swords in our hands,

240
00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:50.460
we marched to the capital
to end to Orochi's rule.

241
00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:52.960
However, we were thwarted.

242
00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:56.420
Kaido's subordinates snuck
into Kuri right behind us!

243
00:14:56.970 --> 00:14:59.010
They infiltrated the castle.

244
00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:00.890
[Oden groans]

245
00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:03.350
[Kin'emon]
Then those rogues threated

246
00:15:03.350 --> 00:15:07.770
the life of Lord Momonosuke,
future heir of the Kozuki Clan!

247
00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:16.240
Forgive me!

248
00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:19.820
[Kin'emon]
In the end,
the enemies were driven back

249
00:15:19.820 --> 00:15:21.870
by Kawamatsu and Dogstorm,

250
00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:24.540
who had been standing
guard at the castle.

251
00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:31.290
[Kin'emon]
However, it was Lady Toki

252
00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:33.880
who truly saved your son's life.

253
00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:38.720
She used her own body to
shield him from a deadly arrow.

254
00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:42.300
My sincerest apologies!

255
00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:44.140
Because of our reckless actions,

256
00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:46.430
she suffered
a terrible leg injury.

257
00:15:46.430 --> 00:15:50.360
We put your family's lives at
risk without thinking first!

258
00:15:50.360 --> 00:15:52.770
I am so sorry, Lord Oden!

259
00:15:52.770 --> 00:15:54.780
This is unforgivable!

260
00:15:55.480 --> 00:15:57.200
Please. Show me.

261
00:15:57.200 --> 00:16:01.120
[Toki]
Oden, I'm fine!
The wound has already healed!

262
00:16:08.120 --> 00:16:11.830
Thank you, Toki.
You saved our child.

263
00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:15.960
It must have hurt!

264
00:16:17.460 --> 00:16:18.920
You can't lash out!

265
00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:20.720
I don't want to
invite another attack

266
00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:23.140
over something so trivial.

267
00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:24.390
[gasps]

268
00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:28.850
You... You...
You call this trivial?

269
00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:35.230
[Oden]
Listen, Toki.
I can handle this myself.

270
00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:37.780
You don't know of my past.

271
00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:39.500
[Oden]
I see now
how Orochi does things.

272
00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:42.500
[Oden]
I see now
how Orochi does things!

273
00:16:43.170 --> 00:16:46.840
Retainers! Stay here
and guard my family!

274
00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:51.220
Please, Oden!

275
00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:55.760
You must protect Kuri!

276
00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:05.180
[Oden]
While I'm not exactly
keen on politics,

277
00:17:05.180 --> 00:17:08.150
I think it's clear what
happened while I was away.

278
00:17:08.150 --> 00:17:11.320
A fool has taken
control of Wano.

279
00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:14.070
A weak, cowardly, little vermin

280
00:17:14.070 --> 00:17:16.950
hid behind the strength
of a fearsome pirate,

281
00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:20.830
and took advantage of a country
where no one could intervene.

282
00:17:25.790 --> 00:17:28.790
[Oden]
I see what he has done.

283
00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:32.500
He's turning this
land into a hellscape!

284
00:17:33.340 --> 00:17:37.720
[Orochi laughing]

285
00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:48.040
[townspeople gasp]

286
00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:54.380
Call back up!

287
00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:57.300
Huh? Come in!

288
00:17:57.300 --> 00:18:00.180
Kozuki Oden is on his way
to the Flower Capital.

289
00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:02.970
Report to Shogun Orochi,
right now!

290
00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:16.580
[Oden yells]

291
00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:22.270
[panting]

292
00:18:22.270 --> 00:18:24.530
[townsperson C]
Will he become the new Shogun?

293
00:18:25.490 --> 00:18:28.280
[townsperson D]
Orochi's reign will finally end!

294
00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:33.800
[Beast pirate H]
Shogun! You must evacuate!

295
00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:36.970
Excuse me? And why
would I do that?

296
00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:42.310
[gasps]

297
00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:44.660
[gasps]

298
00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:55.130
O-Oden? Let's talk!

299
00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:57.550
Don't hurt me! Careful, now!

300
00:18:57.550 --> 00:19:01.470
If you lay one finger on me,
Kaido's not going to like it!

301
00:19:02.680 --> 00:19:04.010
Please think about
what'll happen

302
00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:06.510
to this country if you kill me!

303
00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:12.820
I will... after I
slice you in two.

304
00:19:09.980 --> 00:19:12.980
[Orochi gasps]

305
00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:16.280
[Orochi]
Oh no, I forgot.

306
00:19:20.070 --> 00:19:23.620
[Orochi]
This man's crazy!

307
00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:28.200
[Orochi screams]

308
00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:31.000
Orochi!

309
00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:34.540
Please don't do it! No!

310
00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:46.800
[gasping]

311
00:19:51.720 --> 00:19:55.980
[panting]

312
00:19:58.520 --> 00:20:02.490
What the hell?
Something stands in my way!

313
00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:06.030
A glass shield? It won't break!

314
00:20:06.030 --> 00:20:09.240
[panting]

315
00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:09.330
[Orochi gasps]

316
00:20:07.410 --> 00:20:09.330
[screams]

317
00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:12.460
Stop hiding! Orochi!

318
00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:17.080
Now! You coward!

319
00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:24.760
Be not afraid, you're safe.
I'll protect you.

320
00:20:25.420 --> 00:20:29.050
Have some faith in my
Barrier-Barrier technique.

321
00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:32.090
<b>Kurozumi Semimaru

A Biwa-Playing Priest</b>

322
00:20:32.530 --> 00:20:34.490
Anything attempting
to breach this area

323
00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:37.120
will be repelled, my lord.

324
00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:40.830
Your strength can do
nothing this time, Oden!

325
00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:43.700
[Higurashi chuckles]
Don't look so shocked.

326
00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:46.280
I thought you would be more
familiar with this sort of thing

327
00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:47.580
since you're a pirate.

328
00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:50.330
Have you not witnessed
the superhuman abilities

329
00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:52.620
granted by Devil Fruits?

330
00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:55.030
<b>Kurozumi Higurashi

An Old Woman</b>

331
00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:56.750
[gasps]

332
00:20:56.750 --> 00:20:58.190
You're a power user!

333
00:20:58.190 --> 00:20:58.210
Although in this country,
people call it sorcery.

334
00:20:58.210 --> 00:21:01.010
[cackles]
That's correct.

335
00:21:01.270 --> 00:21:03.440
[cackles]
You fool!

336
00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:05.360
If anger and violence
were the answer,

337
00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:08.190
your little daimyos would
have killed me already!

338
00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:07.680
[gasps]

339
00:21:08.230 --> 00:21:12.900
It's too late for you!
I'm untouchable!

340
00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:21.760
Face me!

341
00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:25.470
I don't understand how
this farce came to be.

342
00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:27.680
All I know is that
my father pushed for you

343
00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:31.730
to be the shogun's proxy,
but only until my return!

344
00:21:31.730 --> 00:21:34.460
[cackles]

345
00:21:34.460 --> 00:21:38.000
I demand that you surrender
the shogun's seat immediately!

346
00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:41.300
I never had any intention of
being the man in charge!

347
00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:45.340
However, I can still do better
for this country than you!

348
00:21:49.750 --> 00:21:51.980
[Orochi chuckles]
Well, that's too bad!

349
00:21:51.980 --> 00:21:56.020
Seems you didn't hear what
Sukiyaki told us before he died!

350
00:21:56.020 --> 00:21:59.570
Hm? And what might that be?

351
00:22:03.530 --> 00:22:07.160
Hello. It's good to
have you back, my son!

352
00:22:07.520 --> 00:22:08.480
[gasps]

353
00:22:08.480 --> 00:22:12.360
[gasps]
Impossible!
How are you alive?

354
00:22:12.360 --> 00:22:14.080
[cackles]

355
00:22:14.080 --> 00:22:18.210
[Orochi]
Your foolish daimyos
were deceived by the same trick!

356
00:22:19.420 --> 00:22:21.550
It was me!

357
00:22:22.170 --> 00:22:24.180
They fell for this hag
in a disguise

358
00:22:24.180 --> 00:22:26.840
thanks to the power of
the Clone-Clone Fruit.

359
00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:28.970
[Orochi cackles]

360
00:22:28.970 --> 00:22:31.520
[Orochi]
The entire country
bought it, for that matter!

361
00:22:31.520 --> 00:22:34.390
They let me take
the shogun's throne!

362
00:22:34.390 --> 00:22:35.730
Get it?

363
00:22:35.730 --> 00:22:39.480
I have no obligation to
give the position to you!

364
00:22:39.480 --> 00:22:41.570
At this point,
nobody can possibly know

365
00:22:41.570 --> 00:22:44.320
what the real Sukiyaki was
thinking on his deathbed.

366
00:22:45.640 --> 00:22:48.120
[gasps]
Bastard!
What did you do to my father?

367
00:22:48.120 --> 00:22:51.240
Did he pass from illness,
or was it you?

368
00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:56.250
[cackles]

369
00:22:56.790 --> 00:23:00.630
[townspeople cheering]

370
00:23:07.640 --> 00:23:10.390
[townsperson E groans]

371
00:23:10.390 --> 00:23:12.430
[narrator]
As the crowds
looked up at the castle,

372
00:23:12.430 --> 00:23:15.230
cheering for the return
of the Kozuki Clan,

373
00:23:15.230 --> 00:23:18.900
poisoned arrows rained down
on them seemingly from nowhere.

374
00:23:18.900 --> 00:23:23.280
Two were injured, spitting up
blood. They both fell blind.

375
00:23:23.280 --> 00:23:26.700
The confused townspeople
could only take shelter.

376
00:23:28.620 --> 00:23:31.490
[narrator]
Suddenly, they
witnessed an enormous dragon

377
00:23:31.490 --> 00:23:34.620
appear in the darkened
sky of the capital!

378
00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:41.250
[Orochi chuckles]

379
00:23:41.250 --> 00:23:45.010
[narrator]
Oden grew from a
wild child to a Daimyo of Kuri,

380
00:23:45.010 --> 00:23:46.800
then went to sea and journeyed

381
00:23:46.800 --> 00:23:49.550
among the world's
greatest pirates.

382
00:23:55.430 --> 00:23:57.770
[narrator]
He returned home
many times stronger

383
00:23:57.770 --> 00:24:00.560
than when he disembarked
on his adventure.

384
00:24:00.860 --> 00:24:04.480
He was a man thought
to be invincible.

385
00:24:05.650 --> 00:24:06.820
Don't you worry.

386
00:24:06.820 --> 00:24:09.950
If anyone, Lord Oden
will save our country!

387
00:24:09.950 --> 00:24:12.450
[girl A gasps]
That's him there!

388
00:24:12.450 --> 00:24:15.080
[townsperson F]
You've returned!
We were waiting for you!

389
00:24:15.080 --> 00:24:16.960
[townsperson G]
Lord Oden!

390
00:24:16.960 --> 00:24:19.580
[narrator]
The people of Wano
saw him as a savior

391
00:24:19.580 --> 00:24:22.630
who could liberate them
from a ruthless tyrant.

392
00:24:23.080 --> 00:24:25.130
[townspeople gasp]

393
00:24:25.130 --> 00:24:26.920
Is he okay?

394
00:24:26.920 --> 00:24:29.090
[narrator]
Within hours of his return,

395
00:24:29.090 --> 00:24:31.720
Kozuki Oden stripped down
to his loincloth

396
00:24:31.720 --> 00:24:34.810
outside of Shogun
Orochi's Palace...

397
00:24:38.160 --> 00:24:40.750
[Beast pirates laugh]

398
00:24:40.750 --> 00:24:44.500
[narrator]
Orochi and Kaido's
underlings laughed at him.

399
00:24:46.540 --> 00:24:52.470
[gasps]
One, two, three.

400
00:24:52.470 --> 00:24:53.800
[narrator]
The once noble man

401
00:24:53.800 --> 00:24:56.600
danced and begged
for spare change.

402
00:24:56.600 --> 00:24:58.600
Then marched away.

403
00:24:59.470 --> 00:25:02.850
[all laughing]

404
00:25:03.180 --> 00:25:05.600
[narrator]
What was supposed to
be a momentous occasion

405
00:25:05.600 --> 00:25:07.440
had become a disappointment.

406
00:25:07.440 --> 00:25:10.110
Kozuki Oden, the rightful
heir to the country

407
00:25:10.110 --> 00:25:12.150
and the man who became
their last hope,

408
00:25:12.150 --> 00:25:14.030
had turned into
a complete laughingstock

409
00:25:14.030 --> 00:25:16.120
to the entire nation.

410
00:25:16.910 --> 00:25:21.790
And soon, their frustration
and confusion gave way to anger.

411
00:25:26.040 --> 00:25:29.760
[Oden]
♪ Fishcakes and eggs, too! ♪

412
00:25:29.760 --> 00:25:33.930
♪ One, two, and three!
Eat it up for me! ♪

413
00:25:33.930 --> 00:25:36.490
♪ Oden wouldn't be Oden! ♪

414
00:25:36.490 --> 00:25:39.820
[narrator]
Oden appeared
in the capital once a week.

415
00:25:39.820 --> 00:25:41.200
He capered about in front of

416
00:25:41.200 --> 00:25:44.240
Orochi's castle
seeking handouts.

417
00:25:45.000 --> 00:25:49.500
In pouring rain,
gale force winds,

418
00:25:49.790 --> 00:25:52.540
and freezing snow.

419
00:25:57.590 --> 00:25:59.800
[Kin'emon]
We are
begging you, Lord Oden!

420
00:25:59.800 --> 00:26:02.010
Tell us the truth!
It's all we ask!

421
00:26:02.010 --> 00:26:04.930
[Dogstorm]
What did you-gara
speak about with Orochi?

422
00:26:04.930 --> 00:26:06.600
Why do this?

423
00:26:06.600 --> 00:26:09.480
You've lost the support of even
your most faithful of followers.

424
00:26:09.480 --> 00:26:12.330
Everyone's grown tired
of this charade!

425
00:26:12.330 --> 00:26:15.590
I choose to dance in the buff
every week as my job!

426
00:26:15.590 --> 00:26:18.380
That's how I support my family!

427
00:26:19.050 --> 00:26:22.510
[narrator]
Word of his antics in
the capital reached Kuri, too.

428
00:26:22.510 --> 00:26:23.680
[children laughing]

429
00:26:23.680 --> 00:26:25.890
[boy A]
♪ Radish and fried tofu! ♪

430
00:26:25.890 --> 00:26:27.970
♪ Some fishcakes
and eggs, too! ♪

431
00:26:27.970 --> 00:26:32.440
♪ Konn-yaku, chiku-wabu,
hanpen potatoes! ♪

432
00:26:32.440 --> 00:26:34.560
♪ Oh, don't forget
one last thing! ♪

433
00:26:34.560 --> 00:26:37.940
♪ Those shirataki
noodles! Not bad! ♪

434
00:26:38.480 --> 00:26:40.190
Whatever you do
when you grow up,

435
00:26:40.190 --> 00:26:41.900
don't be spineless
like Lord Oden.

436
00:26:40.910 --> 00:26:43.710
[Oden laughs]

437
00:26:41.950 --> 00:26:44.700
You think real samurai
would act as a lapdog?

438
00:26:44.700 --> 00:26:45.320
They would sooner
commit seppuku!

439
00:26:45.320 --> 00:26:47.160
♪ Kelp is good for you! ♪

440
00:26:47.160 --> 00:26:49.240
[Oden]
♪ Kelp is good for you! ♪

441
00:26:49.240 --> 00:26:49.370
[Oden]
♪ Better put it in the stew! ♪

442
00:26:49.370 --> 00:26:51.120
♪ Better put it in the stew! ♪

443
00:26:51.380 --> 00:26:51.390
[Oden]
♪ Perfect stock,
and perfect broth, ♪

444
00:26:51.390 --> 00:26:53.380
♪ Perfect stock, and perfect
broth, brewing up for you! ♪

445
00:26:53.380 --> 00:26:55.420
♪ brewing up for you! ♪

446
00:26:55.420 --> 00:26:58.300
[Oden laughs]

447
00:27:03.180 --> 00:27:05.860
[narrator]
Then, a year later.

448
00:27:05.860 --> 00:27:11.440
[Oden crying]

449
00:27:11.440 --> 00:27:13.570
[narrator]
Oden read
the newspaper he received

450
00:27:13.570 --> 00:27:17.280
from abroad
courtesy of Shogun Orochi.

451
00:27:22.920 --> 00:27:28.510
[Oden crying]

452
00:27:25.010 --> 00:27:28.510
[laughing]

453
00:27:28.510 --> 00:27:30.680
[narrator]
He ran up and down the coast.

454
00:27:30.680 --> 00:27:32.810
He couldn't help himself
from wailing,

455
00:27:32.810 --> 00:27:35.980
then laughing,
then wailing again.

456
00:27:36.270 --> 00:27:40.400
[panting]

457
00:27:38.270 --> 00:27:41.730
[laughing]

458
00:27:41.730 --> 00:27:44.730
Oh, Roger!

459
00:27:53.880 --> 00:27:56.390
[narrator]
Twenty-four years
before the present day,

460
00:27:56.390 --> 00:27:58.900
the world was abuzz over
the execution of Gold Roger,

461
00:27:58.900 --> 00:27:59.350
And the King of the Pirates!

462
00:27:59.350 --> 00:28:01.350
the King of the Pirates.

463
00:28:02.180 --> 00:28:04.940
The allure of the vast
fortune he left behind

464
00:28:04.940 --> 00:28:07.190
encouraged countless people
to take to the sea,

465
00:28:07.190 --> 00:28:07.610
of the

466
00:28:07.610 --> 00:28:09.940
all of them hoping to
traverse the Grand Line

467
00:28:09.940 --> 00:28:13.650
and obtain the legendary
treasure, the One Piece.

468
00:28:14.030 --> 00:28:15.070
This was the beginning
of the Great Pirate Era.

469
00:28:15.070 --> 00:28:17.320
The Opening of the
Great Pirate Era!"

470
00:28:21.370 --> 00:28:26.500
[yells]

471
00:28:30.710 --> 00:28:32.960
[sighs]

472
00:28:38.180 --> 00:28:40.890
An unbelievable life.

473
00:28:45.270 --> 00:28:48.190
What a remarkable man.

474
00:28:54.520 --> 00:28:56.100
[narrator]
It is now the second year

475
00:28:56.100 --> 00:28:57.900
since Oden has returned
from his voyage

476
00:28:57.900 --> 00:29:00.190
and a mighty clash has
broken out in Ringo

477
00:29:00.190 --> 00:29:03.490
between the Gecko Pirates
and the Beast Pirates.

478
00:29:04.070 --> 00:29:07.240
Gecko Moria and Kaido
go head-to-head.

479
00:29:07.240 --> 00:29:09.410
Die!

480
00:29:09.410 --> 00:29:12.200
[yells]

481
00:29:15.040 --> 00:29:17.880
[narrator]
While the battle
rages on, a crime is committed.

482
00:29:17.880 --> 00:29:21.800
The grave of Ryuma is ransacked
and Shusui is taken.

483
00:29:21.800 --> 00:29:24.930
Unfortunately,
our hero is preoccupied.

484
00:29:28.020 --> 00:29:30.110
[narrator]
Despite the chaos
in his country,

485
00:29:30.110 --> 00:29:33.200
Oden faithfully dances in
the Flower Capital each week.

486
00:29:33.200 --> 00:29:34.620
I wanna play!

487
00:29:34.620 --> 00:29:35.580
Ignore that man!

488
00:29:35.580 --> 00:29:39.790
♪ Perfect stock, and perfect
broth, brewing up for you! ♪

489
00:29:36.660 --> 00:29:39.540
[Oden laughs]

490
00:29:37.920 --> 00:29:39.540
♪ brewing up for you! ♪

491
00:29:39.540 --> 00:29:39.830
♪ Oden Wouldn't be Oden. ♪

492
00:29:39.830 --> 00:29:42.920
♪ Oden wouldn't be Oden. ♪

493
00:29:42.260 --> 00:29:51.600
<b>Hakumai</b>

494
00:29:42.920 --> 00:29:47.500
♪ If it wasn't
boiled! ♪ [laughs]

495
00:29:47.500 --> 00:29:49.630
The dullard is
in the streets again.

496
00:29:49.630 --> 00:29:52.420
My heart is heavy
for the people of Kuri.

497
00:29:52.420 --> 00:29:54.640
[Yasuie]
The "Foolish Lord," huh?

498
00:29:54.640 --> 00:29:55.720
[townspeople laugh]

499
00:29:55.720 --> 00:29:58.890
Bit of a stretch
to even call him a lord.

500
00:30:04.380 --> 00:30:05.510
[Hiyori grunts, giggles]

501
00:30:05.510 --> 00:30:06.970
[Oden]
I've turned my family into

502
00:30:06.970 --> 00:30:09.430
the laughingstock of the nation.

503
00:30:09.770 --> 00:30:11.440
[Hiyori]
Father!

504
00:30:12.210 --> 00:30:15.000
I love watching you so, so much!

505
00:30:15.000 --> 00:30:16.920
I wanna see you do it, too!

506
00:30:16.920 --> 00:30:21.550
[Oden chuckles]
Hey, Toki.

507
00:30:21.550 --> 00:30:22.280
Yes?

508
00:30:22.280 --> 00:30:23.740
Do you wish to leave me?

509
00:30:23.740 --> 00:30:27.460
Are you saying that in jest?
You'd better be.

510
00:30:28.210 --> 00:30:29.620
[narrator]
Oden became known as

511
00:30:29.620 --> 00:30:32.250
the "Foolish Lord of Kuri"
throughout the country.

512
00:30:32.250 --> 00:30:34.920
The only people still
willing to associate with him

513
00:30:34.920 --> 00:30:38.440
were his family, his retainers,
and a handful of supporters.

514
00:30:38.440 --> 00:30:40.600
[Oden]
Are you certain about this?

515
00:30:40.600 --> 00:30:43.320
You all still wish to
serve as my retainers?

516
00:30:43.200 --> 00:30:45.820
<b>Oden Castle

Kuri</b>

517
00:30:43.320 --> 00:30:45.820
Really think we have
someplace better to be?

518
00:30:45.820 --> 00:30:47.440
My lord, have you forgotten

519
00:30:47.440 --> 00:30:49.990
that we've been acquainted with
your naked dancing for years?

520
00:30:49.990 --> 00:30:52.780
No kiddin'. This is
nothing new to us!

521
00:30:52.780 --> 00:30:54.410
[Cat Viper laughs]

522
00:30:54.410 --> 00:30:55.740
[all laugh]

523
00:31:00.310 --> 00:31:03.940
Back it up! I'd keep a good
distance if I were you!

524
00:31:03.940 --> 00:31:04.940
[Hyogoro's wife]
Stop it!

525
00:31:06.540 --> 00:31:07.480
[subordinates gasp]
Ouch!

526
00:31:07.480 --> 00:31:10.030
[Hyogoro's wife]
That's not
your call to make! Stand back!

527
00:31:10.030 --> 00:31:11.030
As you say!

528
00:31:11.030 --> 00:31:12.360
Sorry, ma'am!

529
00:31:12.360 --> 00:31:13.650
Greeting, Milady!

530
00:31:13.650 --> 00:31:15.620
[Hyogoro's wife]
I apologize for them.

531
00:31:15.620 --> 00:31:17.740
Why not come in
and have some tea?

532
00:31:18.280 --> 00:31:20.700
Oh, Hyo! Oden's here!

533
00:31:21.250 --> 00:31:23.160
[all laugh]

534
00:31:23.160 --> 00:31:25.960
That damned Orochi
just won't leave me alone!

535
00:31:25.960 --> 00:31:29.040
I'd never work for
someone like him. [laughs]

536
00:31:29.040 --> 00:31:32.800
[Oden laughs]
Well,
don't put yourself in danger.

537
00:31:32.800 --> 00:31:33.760
All right, Hyo?

538
00:31:33.760 --> 00:31:35.800
It's funny you stopped by.

539
00:31:35.800 --> 00:31:37.260
I was telling him the other day

540
00:31:37.260 --> 00:31:39.060
your dancing's gotten
so much better.

541
00:31:39.060 --> 00:31:41.180
Stop it, your making me blush.

542
00:31:41.180 --> 00:31:42.600
[Hyogoro's wife laughs]

543
00:31:44.210 --> 00:31:46.980
[Hyogoro laughs]
Anyway, another cup?

544
00:31:46.980 --> 00:31:49.230
[narrator]
Three years pass.

545
00:31:49.560 --> 00:31:52.570
[Oden]
♪ Radish and fried tofu! ♪

546
00:31:53.240 --> 00:31:55.200
♪ Fishcakes and eggs, too! ♪

547
00:31:55.200 --> 00:31:57.700
He's back. Still dancin'
in the streets.

548
00:31:57.700 --> 00:31:59.740
He's certainly devoted
to this nonsense

549
00:31:59.740 --> 00:32:01.450
doing it in the freezing cold.

550
00:32:03.320 --> 00:32:06.340
[Oden sneezes]
It's a bit nippy out here!

551
00:32:06.340 --> 00:32:07.630
[townsperson G]
Has he no shame?

552
00:32:07.630 --> 00:32:08.840
[townsperson H]
He is deranged.

553
00:32:08.840 --> 00:32:10.010
[townsperson I]
How obnoxious.

554
00:32:11.390 --> 00:32:13.810
[narrator]
Four years pass and nothing in

555
00:32:13.810 --> 00:32:16.270
the Land of Wano has changed.

556
00:32:17.560 --> 00:32:19.140
[narrator]
Then in the fifth year,

557
00:32:19.140 --> 00:32:21.860
Orochi makes a move on Kuri.

558
00:32:22.320 --> 00:32:24.280
[Orochi cackles]

559
00:32:24.900 --> 00:32:27.490
It's the shogun!
What's he doing here?

560
00:32:27.490 --> 00:32:28.530
[townspeople gasp]

561
00:32:28.530 --> 00:32:29.870
[Orochi sighs]

562
00:32:57.460 --> 00:33:00.880
I've found the location
for my next weapons factory!

563
00:33:00.880 --> 00:33:02.840
This'll do just fine!

564
00:33:02.840 --> 00:33:05.510
Oden, you do great work.

565
00:33:06.650 --> 00:33:08.360
Shogun, a moment!

566
00:33:08.360 --> 00:33:09.900
You're forgetting something.

567
00:33:09.900 --> 00:33:12.820
What about the ship you
and Kaido promised to m...

568
00:33:17.230 --> 00:33:19.070
[Oden gasps]

569
00:33:20.070 --> 00:33:22.280
Let's go back to
the factory talk!

570
00:33:22.280 --> 00:33:24.030
They need to run effectively,

571
00:33:24.030 --> 00:33:26.660
so I will need
the strongest workers!

572
00:33:26.660 --> 00:33:31.120
I'm sure that the people of Kuri
won't disappoint me. Will they?

573
00:33:33.210 --> 00:33:35.250
Now get to work.

574
00:33:35.250 --> 00:33:39.510
Our country will be the greatest
weapons producer in the world!

575
00:33:43.470 --> 00:33:47.390
Orochi, I beg of you!

576
00:33:47.390 --> 00:33:51.640
Ah, yes! By the way,
Hyogoro became a problem.

577
00:33:51.640 --> 00:33:54.100
I had to call in a little help.

578
00:33:52.920 --> 00:33:54.140
[gasps]

579
00:33:54.140 --> 00:33:56.270
Kaido's taking care of him.

580
00:33:58.730 --> 00:34:01.030
It's not like I didn't want to
work with the old man,

581
00:34:01.030 --> 00:34:04.070
but I grew tired of
his countless rejections.

582
00:34:04.070 --> 00:34:07.160
Ah, such a pity
he'll wind up dead.

583
00:34:07.160 --> 00:34:08.540
[Oden gasps]

584
00:34:08.540 --> 00:34:11.330
His underlings did put up
quite a fight, though.

585
00:34:11.330 --> 00:34:14.210
You unhand our boss, right now!

586
00:34:15.710 --> 00:34:17.790
It's a shame we had to
put them all down!

587
00:34:17.790 --> 00:34:21.760
Oops, theyd've made
fine workers! [laughs]

588
00:34:21.760 --> 00:34:23.300
It's funny thinking back on it,

589
00:34:23.300 --> 00:34:26.010
but even his old lady
tried to fend us off!

590
00:34:26.010 --> 00:34:27.430
She might've been a firecracker,

591
00:34:27.430 --> 00:34:29.890
but what did she think
she was gonna do?

592
00:34:29.890 --> 00:34:32.350
We shot her dead of course.

593
00:34:32.350 --> 00:34:36.230
[Hyogoro's wife]
No! I'll do anything!

594
00:34:36.230 --> 00:34:38.820
Don't take him away from me!

595
00:34:41.400 --> 00:34:42.850
[Hyogoro's wife]
Hyo...

596
00:34:42.850 --> 00:34:45.600
No!

597
00:34:47.070 --> 00:34:49.530
[laughs]

598
00:34:49.530 --> 00:34:51.620
[Orochi]
You'd figure
the wife of a yakuza boss

599
00:34:51.620 --> 00:34:53.790
would have more composure!

600
00:34:56.330 --> 00:35:01.630
Anyway, how are your kids,
Momonosuke and Hiyori?

601
00:35:01.630 --> 00:35:03.760
Getting big now, aren't they?

602
00:35:03.760 --> 00:35:06.180
They really grow up so fast.

603
00:35:06.180 --> 00:35:08.300
Quite a cute little
pair of children

604
00:35:08.300 --> 00:35:10.600
you've raised. I'm sure.

605
00:35:10.600 --> 00:35:12.850
I'd take good care of them.

606
00:35:12.850 --> 00:35:15.980
[cackles]

607
00:35:15.980 --> 00:35:18.230
[Orochi]
I expect to see
progress on that factory

608
00:35:18.230 --> 00:35:19.860
when I get back!

609
00:35:21.850 --> 00:35:23.310
[Oden gasps]

610
00:35:34.660 --> 00:35:41.120
[screams]

611
00:35:44.290 --> 00:35:46.130
[narrator]
That day, it became clear that

612
00:35:46.130 --> 00:35:49.130
the concerns of his family
and retainers were well-founded.

613
00:35:49.130 --> 00:35:52.180
The great samurai had been
carrying a terrible burden

614
00:35:52.180 --> 00:35:54.930
all alone for five long years.

615
00:35:54.930 --> 00:35:57.680
[panting]

616
00:36:03.970 --> 00:36:08.390
Curse you, Orochi and Kaido.

617
00:36:08.720 --> 00:36:10.640
The time is now.

618
00:36:16.190 --> 00:36:18.280
You have our support.

619
00:36:18.280 --> 00:36:21.440
We've waited years to
hear you say those words!

620
00:36:24.530 --> 00:36:26.780
We'll aim for Kaido's island!

621
00:36:27.330 --> 00:36:30.870
Wait for him to drink until
he loses consciousness,

622
00:36:30.870 --> 00:36:33.250
then cut off his head!

623
00:36:35.710 --> 00:36:37.960
[narrator]
Now bear witness.

624
00:36:40.960 --> 00:36:44.300
[narrator]
This is the tale
of Kozuki Oden's uprising.

625
00:36:44.300 --> 00:36:47.970
A tale of courage and tragedy,
for which all of Wano wept.

626
00:36:47.970 --> 00:36:52.270
With him stood the nine men
he shaped into samurai.

627
00:36:52.680 --> 00:36:54.980
It began at twilight.

628
00:36:54.980 --> 00:36:56.520
The sun was a fierce red

629
00:36:56.520 --> 00:36:58.610
as it warmed the backs
of the loyal heroes

630
00:36:58.610 --> 00:37:00.900
marching towards
a long overdue battle.

631
00:37:00.900 --> 00:37:02.820
Even the blades at
their waists seemed

632
00:37:02.820 --> 00:37:05.860
eager to settle things
once and for all.

633
00:37:07.870 --> 00:37:09.700
[narrator]
They were later
honored with the moniker

634
00:37:09.700 --> 00:37:12.580
Akazaya Nine,
or "Red Scabbards,"

635
00:37:12.580 --> 00:37:13.620
referring to their blades,

636
00:37:13.620 --> 00:37:16.210
painted crimson by
the setting sun.

637
00:37:16.210 --> 00:37:17.880
You can't jump higher than me!

638
00:37:17.880 --> 00:37:19.460
I can!

639
00:37:19.460 --> 00:37:21.670
[Momonosuke, Hiyori giggling]

640
00:37:25.590 --> 00:37:28.890
[narrator]
Their sole objective
was to slay the mighty Kaido.

641
00:37:28.890 --> 00:37:32.520
But the stirring tale of their
march is but a cherished memory.

642
00:37:32.520 --> 00:37:34.480
For this story ends tragically

643
00:37:34.480 --> 00:37:37.270
with the execution
of Kozuki Oden.

644
00:37:45.110 --> 00:37:46.820
[narrator]
The renowned series of events

645
00:37:46.820 --> 00:37:48.320
that are about to unfold

646
00:37:48.320 --> 00:37:50.740
will be told for
generations to come

647
00:37:50.740 --> 00:37:54.250
and be known as
the "Hour of Legends."
